  "bio": "Carni Gold is a highly skilled tattoo artist renowned for bright and bold traditional or illustrative ink work, capturing the essence of classic tattoo artistry with a modern flair. Operating out of Edinburgh, United Kingdom, Carni maintains the highest standards of cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every client's tattoo experience. For stunning, eye-catching designs and a commitment to cleanliness, Carni Gold is the artist to trust.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Edinburgh, Scotland, United Kingdom"
